        <briefdescription>
<para>This is the current data we have pulled from the stream but have not returned to the client. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This is specifically and intentionally defined to follow the word size of the host machine for efficiency. We use <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_simple_bitstream_cursor_1a844fc5e45f6ac94e7da1f7f5a94dc604" kindref="member">word_t</ref> in places that are aware of this to make it perfectly explicit what is going on. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
